{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":387360,"duration_api_ms":425595,"num_turns":17,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"88902363-c6eb-42ed-8d03-41f9d05297af","total_cost_usd":1.3119765999999997,"usage":{"input_tokens":12,"cache_creation_input_tokens":69671,"cache_read_input_tokens":610764,"output_tokens":15772,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":69671,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":12,"outputTokens":15772,"cacheReadInputTokens":610764,"cacheCreationInputTokens":69671,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.1351857499999998,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000},"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":4228,"outputTokens":10956,"cacheReadInputTokens":357316,"cacheCreationInputTokens":65641,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.17679085,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"amendments":[],"summary":"Thorough review of the CO2 gas exchange implementation found no bugs, safety issues, or correctness gaps.\n\n**Scientific correctness verified:**\n- Henry's law with van 't Hoff temperature correction is correctly implemented. At 25°C/410 ppm: equilibrium = 0.167 mg C/L (0.61 mg CO2/L), confirmed numerically.\n- K_LA(CO2) = K_LA(O2).min(1.0) × 0.91 correctly applies the diffusion coefficient ratio (√(D_CO2/D_O2) ≈ 0.91) after the Euler stability cap, preserving the physical ratio at all aeration levels.\n- CO2 gas exchange correctly modifies DIC without changing alkalinity (CO2 is a neutral molecule), then re-solves carbonate equilibrium via `resolve_carbonate_state`.\n\n**Unit consistency verified:**\n- `co2_aq_mmol_per_l * 12.0` → mg C/L (12 mg C per mmol CO2): correct.\n- `co2_sat_mg_c_per_l` returns mg C/L: consistent with exchange calculation.\n- Test snapshot helper uses `* 44.0` for mg CO2/L conversions: correct and consistent within tests.\n- Exchange flux = K_LA (h⁻¹) × concentration gradient (mg C/L) × volume (L) = mg C/h: dimensionally correct.\n\n**Numerical stability verified:**\n- K_LA(CO2) ≤ 0.91 (capped at 1.0 before × 0.91), so explicit Euler can never overshoot equilibrium.\n- `carbon_out_mg` guard prevents DIC from going negative.\n- Carbonate solver handles edge cases (zero DIC, negligible alkalinity, negative discriminant, non-finite results) with appropriate fallbacks.\n\n**Engine integration verified:**\n- Chemistry step (step 9) runs before dissolved oxygen (step 10), correctly ordering DIC/pH updates before O2 reaeration.\n- Budget tracking correctly splits CO2 exchange into carbon_in (dissolution) and carbon_out (off-gassing).\n\n**Test coverage verified:**\n- 12 tests pass covering all acceptance criteria: bidirectional exchange, aeration acceleration, surface area effects, equilibrium concentration, temperature dependence, volume independence, respiration coupling, aerated vs non-aerated integration, K_LA ratio verification, and pH rise from CO2 stripping.\n\nNo amendments proposed."},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"ea9bff74-f1b6-475c-8968-0f83b37d2fcf"}
